    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meow meow meow!</strong><br>What if cats could talk? How would they communicate with humans?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Paw to Talk</i>, you play as a clever little kitty who uses talking buttons to express thoughts, interact with humans, complete fun objectives, and unlock heartwarming (and sometimes hilarious) stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But wait...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does Kitty want to learn to talk in the first place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it for snacks?<br>To solve human troubles?<br>Or simply to say \u201cI love you\u201d out loud?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the magical <i>Ticket Meow-chine</i>, where you can collect special stubs to enter a variety of whimsical scenes\u2014each one a new chapter in Kitty\u2019s button-talking adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/720b77329db581f1a62fc0bdf7384cb2.poster.avif?t=1754986959\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/720b77329db581f1a62fc0bdf7384cb2.apng?t=1754986959\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=90 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/e3ee63a3fc2a2bd0ab493dea6ffe28d6.poster.avif?t=1754986959\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/e3ee63a3fc2a2bd0ab493dea6ffe28d6.webm?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/e3ee63a3fc2a2bd0ab493dea6ffe28d6.mp4?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn into a <strong>Treat Machine</strong>, furiously pressing buttons to get all the snacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/f44725d11992e2b38229a06524523247.poster.avif?t=1754986959\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/f44725d11992e2b38229a06524523247.webm?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/e168b8c85d01aa2c9655880f29e65a79.poster.avif?t=1754986959\" width=800 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/e168b8c85d01aa2c9655880f29e65a79.webm?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/e168b8c85d01aa2c9655880f29e65a79.mp4?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a <strong>DJ Kitty</strong>, lighting up the night with your paws on the decks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/6d92787e8c1c438a79dedaa18db1ec00.poster.avif?t=1754986959\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/6d92787e8c1c438a79dedaa18db1ec00.apng?t=1754986959\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=90 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/73dcd66a641473b014972768acbe4448.poster.avif?t=1754986959\" width=616 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/73dcd66a641473b014972768acbe4448.webm?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/73dcd66a641473b014972768acbe4448.mp4?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Kitty with different fur colors and patterns\u2014make it the feline of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_08.png?t=1754986959\" width=616 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, enjoy fun mini-games like <strong>Whack-a-Tentacle</strong> and more surprises waiting for your paws!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meow meow meow!</strong><br>What if cats could talk? How would they communicate with humans?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Paw to Talk</i>, you play as a clever little kitty who uses talking buttons to express thoughts, interact with humans, complete fun objectives, and unlock heartwarming (and sometimes hilarious) stories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But wait...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why does Kitty want to learn to talk in the first place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is it for snacks?<br>To solve human troubles?<br>Or simply to say \u201cI love you\u201d out loud?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the magical <i>Ticket Meow-chine</i>, where you can collect special stubs to enter a variety of whimsical scenes\u2014each one a new chapter in Kitty\u2019s button-talking adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/720b77329db581f1a62fc0bdf7384cb2.poster.avif?t=1754986959\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/720b77329db581f1a62fc0bdf7384cb2.apng?t=1754986959\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=90 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/e3ee63a3fc2a2bd0ab493dea6ffe28d6.poster.avif?t=1754986959\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/e3ee63a3fc2a2bd0ab493dea6ffe28d6.webm?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/e3ee63a3fc2a2bd0ab493dea6ffe28d6.mp4?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn into a <strong>Treat Machine</strong>, furiously pressing buttons to get all the snacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/f44725d11992e2b38229a06524523247.poster.avif?t=1754986959\" width=616 height=90 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/f44725d11992e2b38229a06524523247.webm?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/e168b8c85d01aa2c9655880f29e65a79.poster.avif?t=1754986959\" width=800 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/e168b8c85d01aa2c9655880f29e65a79.webm?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/e168b8c85d01aa2c9655880f29e65a79.mp4?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a <strong>DJ Kitty</strong>, lighting up the night with your paws on the decks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/6d92787e8c1c438a79dedaa18db1ec00.poster.avif?t=1754986959\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/6d92787e8c1c438a79dedaa18db1ec00.apng?t=1754986959\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=90 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/73dcd66a641473b014972768acbe4448.poster.avif?t=1754986959\" width=616 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/73dcd66a641473b014972768acbe4448.webm?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/73dcd66a641473b014972768acbe4448.mp4?t=1754986959\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your Kitty with different fur colors and patterns\u2014make it the feline of your dreams!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622660/extras/catbtn_store_08.png?t=1754986959\" width=616 height=364 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plus, enjoy fun mini-games like <strong>Whack-a-Tentacle</strong> and more surprises waiting for your paws!</p>",
    "short_description": "In Paw to Talk, use buttons to beg for treats, drop beats as a neon-lit DJ, solve cozy hand-drawn mystery puzzles, explore treasure-filled dungeons, and pilot spaceships across the stars to deliver feline passengers. With dozens of art styles and playful scenes, your cat journey begins!",
